   "id": "math.sqrt-table",
   "name": "Square roots from the table",
   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "To find √b from the table of squares, look for b inside the table. Its row gives the first two digits and its column gives the third digit. If b is not in the table, use the nearest value. Moving the point two places in b moves it one place in √b."
    },
    "am": {
     "text": "√b ን ከካሬዎች ሰንጠረዥ ለማግኘት b ን በሰንጠረዡ ውስጥ ፈልግ። ረድፉ የመጀመሪያዎቹን ሁለት አሃዞች፣ አምዱ ሦስተኛውን ይሰጣል።",
     "machine": true
    }
